{"page":149,"width":1832,"height":2840,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"4.5 임국최 스레딤 203","words":[{"text":"4.5","x":1242,"y":184,"width":59,"height":24},{"text":"임국최","x":1318,"y":183,"width":74,"height":28},{"text":"스레딤","x":1402,"y":183,"width":72,"height":29},{"text":"203","x":1554,"y":178,"width":62,"height":30}]},{"text":"병,릴화를 위한 디레터브를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 OpenMP는 개발자가 병릴화 수준","words":[{"text":"병,릴화를","x":334,"y":323,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"위한","x":482,"y":324,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"디레터브를","x":563,"y":324,"width":164,"height":39},{"text":"제공할","x":744,"y":323,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"뿐만","x":861,"y":324,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"아니라","x":945,"y":322,"width":103,"height":41},{"text":"OpenMP는","x":1062,"y":322,"width":194,"height":45},{"text":"개발자가","x":1274,"y":321,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"병릴화","x":1430,"y":322,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"수준","x":1547,"y":323,"width":71,"height":39}]},{"text":"을 선대할 수 있게 한다. 예를 들면, 개발자는 필요한 스레드의 개수를 직접 정할 수 있","words":[{"text":"을","x":269,"y":386,"width":33,"height":39},{"text":"선대할","x":318,"y":387,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":432,"y":389,"width":32,"height":38},{"text":"있게","x":481,"y":389,"width":60,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":559,"y":388,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":649,"y":388,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"들면,","x":730,"y":388,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"개발자는","x":823,"y":387,"width":137,"height":40},{"text":"필요한","x":977,"y":387,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"스레드의","x":1091,"y":386,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"개수를","x":1246,"y":387,"width":103,"height":40},{"text":"직접","x":1366,"y":388,"width":62,"height":40},{"text":"정할","x":1450,"y":388,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":1533,"y":388,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있","x":1586,"y":388,"width":32,"height":38}]},{"text":"다. 개발자는 또한 데이터를 스레드들이 공유할 것인지 국은 특정 스레드만 A卜\u0026할 것인","words":[{"text":"다.","x":270,"y":452,"width":40,"height":38},{"text":"개발자는","x":328,"y":452,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"또한","x":472,"y":454,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":552,"y":453,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"스레드들이","x":696,"y":452,"width":165,"height":40},{"text":"공유할","x":879,"y":453,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"것인지","x":998,"y":452,"width":96,"height":40},{"text":"국은","x":1111,"y":452,"width":69,"height":39},{"text":"특정","x":1192,"y":453,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"스레드만","x":1276,"y":454,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"A卜\u0026할","x":1429,"y":453,"width":107,"height":39},{"text":"것인","x":1550,"y":452,"width":66,"height":40}]},{"text":"지도 정할 수 있다. OpenMP는 Linux, Windows 및 macOS 시스템을 위한 다수의","words":[{"text":"지도","x":272,"y":517,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"정할","x":354,"y":517,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"수","x":433,"y":518,"width":33,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":483,"y":518,"width":71,"height":39},{"text":"OpenMP는","x":571,"y":520,"width":187,"height":43},{"text":"Linux,","x":774,"y":520,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"Windows","x":900,"y":521,"width":166,"height":33},{"text":"및","x":1086,"y":518,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"macOS","x":1133,"y":522,"width":122,"height":32},{"text":"시스템을","x":1273,"y":519,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"위한","x":1428,"y":519,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"다수의","x":1514,"y":518,"width":100,"height":39}]},{"text":"공개 소스와 상용 컴파일러에서 사용할 수 있다. 우리는 OpenMP에 대해 더 알고 싶은","words":[{"text":"공개","x":271,"y":582,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"소스와","x":352,"y":582,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"상용","x":464,"y":583,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"컴파일러에서","x":545,"y":583,"width":193,"height":40},{"text":"사용할","x":757,"y":583,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"수","x":870,"y":585,"width":34,"height":39},{"text":"있다.","x":921,"y":585,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"우리는","x":1010,"y":584,"width":102,"height":40},{"text":"OpenMP에","x":1125,"y":585,"width":190,"height":46},{"text":"대해","x":1334,"y":584,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"더","x":1417,"y":584,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"알고","x":1464