":"큐에서","x":1517,"y":1115,"width":98,"height":39}]},{"text":"태스크를 제거할 때 관리하는 스레드 풀에서 가용 스레드를 선택하여 태스크를 할당한다.","words":[{"text":"태스크를","x":278,"y":1184,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"제거할","x":420,"y":1182,"width":99,"height":40},{"text":"때","x":531,"y":1182,"width":28,"height":40},{"text":"관리하는","x":574,"y":1183,"width":135,"height":39},{"text":"스레드","x":720,"y":1181,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"풀에서","x":833,"y":1182,"width":100,"height":40},{"text":"가용","x":950,"y":1182,"width":69,"height":40},{"text":"스레드를","x":1031,"y":1182,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"선택하여","x":1181,"y":1183,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"태스크를","x":1329,"y":1183,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"할당한다.","x":1475,"y":1181,"width":144,"height":39}]},{"text":"GCD는 z/g(serial)과 \"(concurrent)의 두 가지 유형의 디스패지 큐를 유지한다.","words":[{"text":"GCD는","x":277,"y":1251,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"z/g(serial)과","x":406,"y":1248,"width":216,"height":43},{"text":"\"(concurrent)의","x":637,"y":1248,"width":308,"height":43},{"text":"두","x":960,"y":1250,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"가지","x":1008,"y":1248,"width":64,"height":40},{"text":"유형의","x":1088,"y":1248,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"디스패지","x":1204,"y":1248,"width":131,"height":40},{"text":"큐를","x":1350,"y":1250,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"유지한다.","x":1430,"y":1247,"width":144,"height":40}]},{"text":"직릴 큐에 넣어진 태스크는 FIFO 순서대로 제거된다. 태스크는 큐에서 제거되면 다","words":[{"text":"직릴","x":341,"y":1315,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"큐에","x":417,"y":1314,"width":63,"height":40},{"text":"넣어진","x":497,"y":1314,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"태스크는","x":611,"y":1315,"width":134,"height":39},{"text":"FIFO","x":757,"y":1317,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"순서대로","x":858,"y":1314,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"제거된다.","x":1012,"y":1314,"width":145,"height":40},{"text":"태스크는","x":1173,"y":1314,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"큐에서","x":1322,"y":1314,"width":98,"height":40},{"text":"제거되면","x":1438,"y":1313,"width":134,"height":40},{"text":"다","x":1588,"y"